        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXINquZSN0Hbe0GpQGWA2g1YCoVBqAspjM4lxAmTAeLmjnV32OWiQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Found this little gem of a place. Recently opened east european grocery store. So happy I don’t have to cross the bridge and go to the island anymore!! Has all the basics and more. Very friendly staff. I highly recommend for anyone. I will be back for more 🫶\n\nAlso for all the people giving unfair 1 star review because they’re not satisfied with pricing, you are free to go elsewhere to shop. It’s not nice to ruin someone’s algorithm just for that.",
        "time": 1758984018,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ida Golovkin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111477575078577701128/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVyxINtVQL85zSHTYiwaeVBdH260Fylt-Lo7tAgvn73X3wiBGU5yA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I just visited the newly opened store and was impressed! The place is well organized, spotless, and the shelves are well stocked with plenty of great staples. They have lots of Eastern European classics at very reasonable prices, including smoked fish, black bread and everything pickled. The staff and owners were very friendly, definitely shopping here again.",
        "time": 1726948794,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lucas Cimachowski",
